Source: edgeos-ipv6-sadr
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vadim Petrov <vadim@vadimpetrov.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: edgeos-ipv6-sadr
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, perl, iproute2
Recommends: systemd
Description: native IPv6 source-address-dependent routing for EdgeOS
 Adds a native protocols ipv6-sadr configuration subtree, a Perl
 reconciler and early-boot guard. The implementation uses the Linux RPDB
 with an internal destination whitelist and per-policy provider tables.
 .
 This package is implementation and off-device qualification only. It does
 not constitute an EdgeOS compatibility claim, and installation on a
 production router is not authorized by the package itself.
